---

This project is a fork of Stirling-PDF (https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF),
with the following material changes:

- The Java/Spring Boot backend has been removed entirely and replaced with
  client-side processing via WebAssembly (pdfcpu, https://github.com/pdfcpu/pdfcpu,
  compiled to WASM), so PDF operations run locally with no server component.
- Code originating from Stirling-PDF's restricted-license directories
  (`proprietary/`, `saas/`, `cloud/`, `desktop/`, and the `engine/` module)
  has been removed and is not included in this repository.

Third-party components used by this project retain their own licenses:

- pdfcpu (https://github.com/pdfcpu/pdfcpu) — Apache License 2.0